# Secrets and machine-local state never enter an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.vercel
.git
.tmp
graphify-out
reference
docs
.agents
supabase
scripts/*
!scripts/rpc-retry-proxy.ts
# The web client ships on Vercel and contracts are not built here; keep only the web manifest so the
# frozen workspace lockfile still resolves.
contracts
apps/web/*
!apps/web/package.json
